            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.23.8+2SA.23.9+2SA.23.10+2SA.23.11+2SA.23.12+2SA.23.13+2SA.23.14+2SA.23.15+2SA.23.16+2SA.23.17+2SA.23.18+2SA.23.19+2SA.23.20+2SA.23.21+2SA.23.22+2SA.23.23+2SA.23.24+2SA.23.25+2SA.23.26+2SA.23.27+2SA.23.28+2SA.23.29+2SA.23.30+2SA.23.31+2SA.23.32+2SA.23.33+2SA.23.34+2SA.23.35+2SA.23.36+2SA.23.37+2SA.23.38+2SA.23.39"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 23:8-39",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.11.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bus 11:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Aba nibo baabaire bari bakuru omu mamanzi ga Daudi abaamuhaire munonga emikono omu bugabe bwe, bakakwatanisa n'Abaisraeli boona kumwemeka, nk'ekigambo kya MUKAMA eki yaagambire ahari Israeli oku kyabaire kir. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.12.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bus 12:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ebi nibyo birikugambwa aha mamanzi agu Daudi yaabaire aine. Yashobeamu owa Hakimooni niwe yaabaire ari mukuru omuri abo abashatu; akakwata eicumu rye, yaariitsa abantu magana ashatu omurundi gumwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
