            "sid": "1CH 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Benaaya mwene Yehoyaada owa Kabuzieli, owaabaire ari emanzi, akakora eby'amaani, yaita bene Arieli babiri aba Moabu. Kandi aha izooba rimwe omu biro by'ebirika akashuuma, yaitira entare omu kiina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.17.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 17:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi yaita Omunyamisri muraingwa munonga, oburaingwa bwe mikono etaano. Ogwo Munyamisri akaba aine eicumu omu ngaro, orubango rwaryo ruri nk'empimbi ei barukiraho emyenda; yaamushuumira n'enkoni, yaamusikura eryo icumu omu ngaro, yaarimwitsa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyo nibyo Benaaya mwene Yehoyaada yaakozire, akarangaanwa nk'abo abashatu ab'amaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaarangaanwa omuri abo makumi ashatu, kwonka tiyaahika hari bari abashatu. Daudi yaamuhindura omukuru w'abarinzi be. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.27.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bus 27:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi ago mamanzi g'omu mahe nigo aga- Asaheeli murumuna wa Yoabu, Elihanani mwene Dodo owa Betelehemu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shamosi owa Harodi, Helezi owa Pelooni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
